- op: discuss  # d026
  at: '2026-10-15T08:43:06Z'  # d026
  by: agent  # d026
  actor: jgstern_agent  # d026
  clock: 3  # d026
  nonce: d026  # d026
  message: "Merged in PR #1606 (ee7dcb505c). spec_validator._check_confidence_range judges an edge whose origins are all registered linker pass ids (catalog.all_linker_pass_ids: emitted PASS_IDs, 64; imports hypergumbo_core.cli so a validator run outside the CLI still sees the linkers) against confidence.LINKER_CONFIDENCE_RANGE (0.40-0.95); a mixed analyzer+linker origin keeps the analyzer band. Behavioural evidence, production path validate_ir (test_spec_validator_smoke.py): graphql-linker edge at 0.9 on ast_call_direct -> no violation; same value from origin 'python' -> violation expected [0.5, 0.85]; graphql-linker at 0.97 -> violation expected [0.4, 0.95]; mixed origin -> violation. The 7 linker sites at 0.9 (caddy_module_dispatch, graphql, graphql_resolver, grpc, openapi, tauri_ipc, vue_template_method) are therefore in range by ruling; check-confidence-sites judges linker files by the same range and reports 0. test_websocket's sweep now uses linker=True (supersedes INV-zatug's July ruling)."  # d026
